  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Sleepwalker** (2 reviews): Stu incorporated a brief China Cat segment into the performance of this track [3][4]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Black Tooth**: rare: 14 archived performances [5]\n- **intermission: Smoke & Mirrors**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [5]\n- **banter: got the hots for ya**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [5]\n- **Presumptuous**: rare: 9 archived performances [5]\n- **intro Leah**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **kglw2022-10-02.R07** (recommended): source not stated; 29 songs; 180 min; rated 4/5 by 1 [1]\n- **kglw2022-10-02.schoeps**: audience recording; 30 songs; 167 min; rated 4/5 by 1 [2]. Said about its sound: The recording likely features Schoeps microphones positioned in a hat down front [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Leah Senior joined the band for The Reticent Raconteur and Lord of Lightning [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kglw2022-10-02.R07**: taped by XQ; transferred by XQ; source: Roland R07 [1]. Also: XQ recorded the R07 audio, noting it was not from the AT2022 event [1]\n- **kglw2022-10-02.schoeps**: taped by Anonymous; transferred by MrCompletely; source: \"Probably Schoeps in a hat down front\" - Unknown audience recording > 24/48 WAV by Anonymous [2]",
